- Phase: final validation
- Candidate: package 0.5.0 assembled from the current main worktree
- Active findings: DT-DATA-07 (one ambiguous record); DT-EVIDENCE-09; DT-ATTACH-10
- Worker/task IDs: Sol navigation `87e353ce-406a-4f43-a724-a327f6216046`; Sol migration `e8b91577-6c65-41da-af23-8dc1d57f873e`; Sol worker evidence `7ec5f9ef-9d89-463f-b89c-503cb7b83275`
- Last completed action: regenerated the 0.5.0 artifact and passed 218 tests with one Windows-only skip
